Description: PlasmaX shell for the X-OS desktop
 X-OS is a Debian Stable based operating system with its own PlasmaX
 Wayland desktop shell. This package contains the plasmex binary:
 top bar, dock, launcher, control center, notification center and
 lock screen built on Qt Quick, with the Liquid Glass material
 implemented as token-driven QML components.
 .
 This shell replaces plasmashell inside the X-OS session.
